        <mxCell id="GNxt3As7fZ05kGszeDXf-12" value="&lt;b&gt;GitHub Codespaces Overview:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Runs a full development environment in the cloud.&lt;br&gt;- Uses containers or virtual machines managed by GitHub.&lt;br&gt;- Based on VS Code, accessible via browser or local VS Code.&lt;br&gt;- Each codespace has isolated CPU, RAM, and filesystem.&lt;br&gt;- The underlying infrastructure uses similar virtualization principles as above." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" vertex="1" parent="1">
